&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Residency in Germany is required. This role is currently fully remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At JFrog, we’re reinventing DevOps to help the world’s greatest companies innovate -- and we want you along for the ride. This is a special place with a unique combination of brilliance, spirit and just all-around great people. Here, if you’re willing to do more, your career can take off. And since software plays a central role in everyone’s lives, you’ll be part of an important mission. Thousands of customers, including the majority of the Fortune 100, trust JFrog to manage, accelerate, and secure their software delivery from code to production -- a concept we call “liquid software.” Wouldn&#39;t it be amazing if you could join us in our journey?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Solution Architect &lt;/strong&gt;to be on the front lines, working closely with our customers and prospects, guiding them on how to build robust DevSecOps processes. You will work with our sales, product, customer success &amp;amp; engineering teams to help customers understand the value of JFrog Solution from a technical and business perspective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you love working with brilliant people, being part of an energetic team and changing the world of software, you might be the perfect Frog to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Solution Architect, New Logo in JFrog you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and Collaborate with account executives to understand customer requirements and propose customized technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives into technical requirements and solution designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct discovery sessions, technical presentations, and product demonstrations for prospective customers in both English and German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct compelling Proof of Values (POVs), and product demonstrations to showcase the value and impact of JFrog solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support transition from pre-sales to post-sales, ensuring continuity and alignment of expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to RFPs, RFIs, and technical questionnaires, including those in German-speaking markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent JFrog at industry events and conferences, highlighting the transformative potential of JFrog products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence JFrog’s product roadmap by communicating customer feedback and identifying trends in the DevOps and DevSecOps landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends, continuously enhancing your knowledge of emerging technologies in DevOps, cloud infrastructure, and software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be a Solution Architect, New Logo in JFrog you need...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7-10+ years of experience in technical sales, presales, or sales engineering roles (experience with MEDDPICC is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in DevOps tools and methodologies, including Docker, Kubernetes, CI servers, Git, Artifactory, and build tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building software pipelines using diverse DevOps tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt; with Linux and cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, or GCP) – mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with software architecture design, scalable product development, and on-premise/cloud hybrid environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering POVs and technical demonstrations to diverse stakeholders, from technical teams to business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-centric mindset with a &quot;can-do&quot; attitude and a passion for learning and solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and presentation skills, capable of translating technical concepts into business value for varied audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

854408f0dc259258.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engelhart was founded in 2013 by BTG Pactual Group as a commodities trading company. Our business model is “asset light” and highly diversified – giving us the ability to adapt effectively and nimbly to changing market conditions. We have assembled successful multidisciplinary teams, leveraging advanced fundamental analysis with deep quantitative and weather research capabilities.&amp;nbsp; Our activities are underpinned by strong risk management practices and by powerful technology and operational excellence. We have exceptional teams with diverse global backgrounds and decades of experience, and are driven by a highly collaborative culture, across products and competencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Engelhart acquired Trailstone, a global energy trading and technology company. The acquisition provides us with new expertise, analytics and proprietary technology which is being used to provide risk management and optimisation services to help maximise the value of our clients’ renewable power. The acquisition also expanded Engelhart’s capabilities into physical natural gas across North America, a critical fuel to support the energy transition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our talented and experienced individuals work together according to its four company values: &lt;strong&gt;Performance, Agility, Collaboration, Entrepreneurship&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;As Principal Data Engineer, you will own the intraday and end-of-day data serving layer between the CTRM platform and its downstream consumers. You will shape the architecture, standards and engineering practices that enable teams across the business to access trusted, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;timely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; and well-defined data. This is a hands-on technical leadership role with the opportunity to influence how the business builds and uses its data platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;This will be a full-time role, based in our London office, owning the following&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the intraday and EOD data serving layer between the CTRM platform and its consumers, including Market Risk, Credit Risk, Treasury, Finance, Reporting and desk tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design and maintain robust data schemas and serving contracts, including SQL, APIs and Kafka-based distribution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define data versioning and reproducibility patterns, including as-of timestamps and run IDs, snapshots and incremental updates, with appropriate treatment of position and P&amp;amp;L data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the CTRM-to-warehouse data pipeline, ensuring reliable ingestion, transformation, validation and delivery to downstream consumers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the implementation and production use of the data warehouse serving layer, closing out the current proof of concept and turning it into a production-ready platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Set engineering standards for data modelling, schema evolution, data quality, observability, testing and operational support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and operate solutions using relevant platform technologies, including ClickHouse, S3, Kafka and schema registry tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work closely with stakeholder teams to understand their needs, propose solutions, explain trade-offs and establish clear, dependable data contracts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership to the data engineering team, raising the quality of design and implementation while encouraging collaboration, constructive challenge and continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Help shape the longer-term data architecture and engineering approach as the business and its data requirements evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;You will be a technically strong and proactive data engineering leader who can turn complex business requirements into robust, scalable data products. You are comfortable supporting multiple teams, bringing forward clear recommendations and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;new ideas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;, and engaging constructively when your designs are challenged. You want to help shape the future data architecture of the business, not simply deliver against a predefined specification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;As a result, we believe the following experiences and skills are essential for this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience designing and building data warehouses; this is a non-negotiable requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on production experience with ClickHouse; this is a non-negotiable requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience delivering a columnar OLAP data platform in production, with a strong understanding of analytical query performance and data modelling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practical experience with Kafka and event-driven or streaming data architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong Python engineering skills and sufficient C# literacy to work effectively with systems and codebases that use C#.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience modelling versioned position and P&amp;amp;L data, including point-in-time or as-of views and reproducible runs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working in a trading or other time-sensitive, data-intensive business environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Previous technical leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, including setting standards and guiding engineering decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills, with the confidence to put forward solutions, bring ideas into discussions and engage positively with challenge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A solution-oriented mindset and the ability to balance the needs of multiple downstream teams while maintaining coherent platform standards.&lt;

0caa72c2dcebce66.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director, Performance Creative Strategy at Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming (FBG), you are responsible for defining the strategic priorities, audience opportunities and learning agenda that shape Fanatics Casino performance creative. You’ll uncover the hooks, angles and player insights most likely to resonate, translate them into clear, inspiring briefs for the internal creative team, and track performance to understand what works and why. This role is the strategic link between player insight, creative development and performance results, ensuring the right problems are being solved and that learnings continuously inform future briefs across acquisition, engagement and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position reports directly to the Senior Director, Performance Creative &amp;amp; GTM, and manages one Associate, Performance Creative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Casino performance creative strategy across paid social, app networks, CTV, affiliates and lifecycle, aligned with business priorities, audience insight and brand positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve the Casino creative variation framework, mapping hooks, angles, reasons to believe, formats and offers to audience and funnel stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives and player insight into clear, inspiring briefs for the internal creative agency, including scripts, hook variations and iteration briefs on winning concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Casino testing agenda, defining what we want to learn, how we measure a win, and which tests run each month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a high-velocity testing program across hooks, openers, formats, offers and creators, continuously improving hit rate and speed to learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Media and Analytics to track creative performance, identify winners and fatigue early, and apply learnings to the next round of briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write concise test readouts and maintain a living library of what works for Casino players.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and define the performance territories, audience tensions and messaging opportunities to support creative briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed performance requirements into brand and full-funnel campaign briefs from the outset (in collaboration with integrated marketing and media), ensuring channel, audience, format and measurement needs are clear before creative development begins. Partner with the Casino Creative Studio to translate those requirements into effective creative, with the Studio retaining ownership of creative direction and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Brand and agency partners on hooks, edits, cutdowns, aspect ratios and platform-native versions, so big campaign moments carry through to always-on performance and lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source player insight, competitor ad libraries, creator content and platform trends to identify new angles and white space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead performance strategy/creative insight sessions and contribute a strong POV to creative brainstorms, working closely with the Casino Creative Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present performance learnings and recommendations in GTM forums and monthly reviews, turning results into a clear story for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor and develop an Associate, building their craft in briefing, analysis and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How This Role Connects Across the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with the internal producer, who owns production timelines and delivery, to keep briefs, priorities and the content calendar aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with the Casino Creative Studio and Integrated Marketing to shape high-quality output, providing direction and feedback while respecting executional ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with Brand and Integrated Marketing to embed performance best practice into campaigns, ensuring work is both distinctive and built to perform across the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with Media, Analytics and CRM to define success measures, read results and feed learnings back into strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with Legal, Compliance and Creative Operations to keep all creative compliant and aligned with Responsible Gaming standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the affiliates teams to produce UGC briefs aligned to channel best practice, adapting content that’s optimised for performance (via creative briefs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in creative strategy, performance creative or brand strategy, including 3+ years leading creative strategy for a fast-growing D2C brand, mobile app, gaming or casino business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating hook-led, insight-driven creative and the performance results behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of platform-native creative across Meta, TikTok, YouTube, Snap and app networks, including UGC and creator formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record building and running creative testing programs at volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to read performance data, size results and translate them into clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storytelling and writing skills, from a 6-second hook to a campaign narrative to an executive readout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing brand and integrated campaigns across matrixed teams without direct ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally for team meetings and Fanatics events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connection and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-JM3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

192756e557710797.description:
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sales team at SevenRooms is on a mission to reshape the hospitality industry by empowering operators to take control of their guest relationships. We’re a passionate, high-performing group of go-getters who act as trusted advisors to restaurants and hospitality groups around the world. We take a consultative approach to sales—identifying business gaps, crafting thoughtful solutions, and helping operators reduce reliance on third-party networks. We believe in the power of hospitality, and we’re proud to partner with businesses to streamline operations and deliver magical guest experiences every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, you’ll work directly with restaurants and hospitality groups to understand their business needs and recommend the best-fit SevenRooms solutions—from reservations and table management to online ordering and marketing automation. You’ll drive new business by adding operators to the platform and working closely with our onboarding and account teams to ensure a smooth and enthusiastic transition. This role plays a key part in helping hospitality operators thrive, combining strategic thinking, relationship-building, and product knowledge to deliver real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Manage a Sales Pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;. Identify and engage prospective restaurants and hospitality groups to grow your book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Showcase the Platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Present the value of SevenRooms through compelling demos and conversations that help operators understand how we can support their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Sales from Start to Finish.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the full sales cycle—from prospecting and pitching to negotiation, contracting, and go-live support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Live Product Demos.&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct live, engaging product walkthroughs both virtually and in person when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Trusted Partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships with prospects and clients, always advocating for their success and acting as a true advisor throughout the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of experience in hospitality technology sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re confident presenting to clients both in person and virtually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re self-driven and comfortable working independently, whether in the office or remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re tech-savvy and quick to pick up new tools and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re results-oriented and bring energy and focus to your daily work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked with tools like Salesforce, Outreach, or similar systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a background in hospitality or restaurants (a big plus!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re open to occasional travel into key markets to connect with clients face-to-face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You speak fluent French&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provide Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023, and resumed using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; again on June 29, 2024.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here: &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot; href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;Covey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SevenRooms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2011, Joel Montaniel, Allison Page, and Kinesh Patel founded SevenRooms after noticing that hospitality operators were missing a critical ingredient in the systems they were using to run their business: guest data. What began as a mission to help restaurants better understand and serve their guests evolved into a powerful platform used by merchants around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With best-in-class tools for marketing, operations, and guest experience — all deeply integrated with its industry-leading CRM — SevenRooms empowers operators to drive revenue, streamline operations, and deliver experiences that keep guests coming back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2025, DoorDash acquired SevenRooms to strengthen its in-store strategy and expand its merchant-first offerings. The combination brings together DoorDash’s scale, reach, and digital innovation with SevenRooms’ in-store capabilities to support hospitality businesses across every channel — from discovery and delivery to on-premise dining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As DoorDash builds out its in-store capabilities, SevenRooms plays a central role in enabling merchants to grow their businesses and connect more meaningfully with guests, whether they’re ordering online or dining in. This move reflects DoorDash’s broader commitment to empowering local businesses, fostering stronger connections between consumers and the places they love, and building technology that meets merchants — and their customers — wherever they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

caf894780e271ed1.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every mind is unique. Yet much of the world is still built for what’s considered &quot;normal,&quot; leaving too many people behind. At Everway, we change that by creating technology that helps everyone understand and be understood. By understanding and addressing the unique needs of each individual, we&#39;re creating a world where differences are recognized and valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our careers fit real life. When you join us, you’re not just taking a job. You’re joining a movement to build a more neuroinclusive world. We’re a global community of over 800 employees spanning North America, UK, Europe, Australia, and New Zealand. A career here is purposeful and fast-moving, with clear expectations, modern tools, and the clarity to focus on what matters most.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our people are supported and encouraged to show up as they are, with different ways of thinking welcomed and valued. We pride ourselves on our core values that are embedded within our culture. These are to &lt;strong&gt;be curious, have courage, and commit fully&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at Everway - together, we can unlock the full potential of every mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everway is building a modern data capability to help teams make better decisions across the business. As a Data Analyst, you&#39;ll work with colleagues across Information Systems and other functions to transform data into meaningful insight that supports operational, commercial and product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Data Team, helping maintain high-quality data, developing reporting, and identifying trends that enable the business to act with confidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, clean and analyse data from a variety of sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain data quality, accuracy and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain data models, dashboards and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to understand data requirements and business questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse trends and patterns to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data-driven initiatives across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and implementation of data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with developments in data analysis tools and best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or equivalent practical experience in a quantitative discipline such as mathematics, statistics, computer science or software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years&#39; experience in a Data Analyst or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with SQL, Excel and at least one analytical programming language such as Python or R.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data modelling and statistical analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating dashboards and visualisations using tools such as Tableau, Power BI or Looker Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders and works effectively with colleagues across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates attention to detail and a commitment to producing accurate, reliable data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Databricks or similar data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within the education technology sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Confluence or a similar documentation platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to improve analysis, reporting or workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#everway&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our team and enjoy a competitive salary with bonus opportunities, flexible work schedules, and comprehensive health and wellness benefits. We offer flexible time off plans, career growth through development programs, and a collaborative, innovative culture where your ideas matter.&amp;nbsp; Ready to make an impact? Apply today and be part of a company that invests in your success!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing a Drug-Free Workplace for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can view our Recruitment and Selection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yDxHyVbhh8MK9NnCYdnEAfVSO4rhPCovVbKK8ecxT4U/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the link for our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uAKvHVSRsqZ83CGhM3_3Dc6RPsXwlTdmwdUH7msHkVM/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

655c8fc3227c2f19.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today, SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of making life multiplanetary and expanding consciousness to the stars.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SpaceXSI is building Super Intelligence to help humanity understand the universe. Our teams are building the full Super Intelligence stack: from our Colossus supercomputers, to Grok models, to our suite of applications, including Grok Bot, Grok Build, Grok Imagine, Grok Voice, and X. We&#39;re creating a powerful flywheel where more compute trains better models, better models power more useful products, and what we learn from people using those products shapes what we build next.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;GLOBAL GOVERNMENT AFFAIRS DIRECTOR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking Global Government Affairs Director to support SpaceXSI’s business and growth objectives primarily in London/UK through direct global lobbying efforts and strategic coalition building on a range of issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own SpaceXSI’s market development and stakeholder engagement strategy for the region. You will lead efforts to position SpaceXSI as the trusted partner for frontier AI deployments across the European governments. This role combines strategic market leadership, high-level stakeholder engagement, revenue acceleration, and cross-functional influence. You will operate as an individual contributor while collaborating closely with global and local leadership to ensure government priorities align with and inform SpaceXSI’s broader international growth. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the identification, qualification, and development of European governments and strategic enterprise opportunities, building and managing a robust pipeline for Enterprise Sales teams to convert into revenue-generating agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct rigorous market research and competitive analysis to assess demand for SpaceXSI&#39;s technologies, map the European AI and public sector landscape, identify barriers to entry, and develop strategies that accelerate SpaceXSI’s growth in Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate SpaceXSI’s brand and presence in Europe as a mission-driven, trusted leader in frontier AI, positioning the company as the partner of choice for transformative public sector and critical national infrastructure initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and expand a senior-level network of advocates and partners across Europe national governments, local government, academia, industry bodies, and the private sector to champion SpaceXSI’s growth and open strategic doors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive significant increases in win rates on complex European government and strategic enterprise deals by providing strategic counsel, executive sponsorship, and high-touch enablement to pursuit and sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape favorable funding, procurement, policy, and regulatory conditions that enable SpaceXSI’s successful market entry, expansion, and long-term positioning in Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive-level air cover and personal leadership on the highest-priority European pursuits, including leading government briefings, negotiations, and strategic relationship management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate deal velocity from opportunity identification through contract award, signature, and successful launch, removing obstacles and orchestrating cross-functional resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global Sales, Engineering, Product, and Legal teams to improve competitive positioning, tailor solutions to public sector requirements, and maximize win probability on strategic opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional alignment with Sales, Marketing, Legal, Product, Engineering, and Finance to ensure European market strategy and execution are fully integrated with SpaceXSI’s global priorities and product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact enablement resources, market intelligence, and thought leadership that accelerate opportunities. Systematically gather and synthesize European customer requirements and advocate for them with product and engineering teams to iterate and enhance SpaceXSI offerings for public sector use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape customer and stakeholder thinking of aligning with SpaceXSI’s unique strengths and value proposition, helping European governments understand how frontier AI can transform their missions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and help enable SpaceXSI’s global government affairs strategy from the European vantage point, ensuring strong coordination and knowledge sharing across EMEA and other international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and sustain trusted senior relationships with ministers, senior civil servants, agency leaders, regulators, and strategic partners to create durable competitive advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor, analyze, and mitigate geopolitical, economic, regulatory, policy, security, and reputational risks in the region that could affect market access, compliance, or ongoing operations; develop and execute mitigation and contingency plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, track, and report on key performance metrics — including pipeline value, win rates, deals closed, policy/regulatory milestones, and revenue impact — and provide regular strategic updates to global leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in government affairs, public policy, market access, strategic business development, or regulatory affairs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of direct people leadership experience managing government affairs teams/personnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and leverage senior-level relationships with government officials, policymakers, and C-suite executives, and to influence outcomes in complex, matrixed environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, current knowledge of the UK &amp;amp; European government ecosystem, AI and digital transformation policy priorities and public sector innovation agendas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience engaging with or influencing government departments and agencies such as UK’s DSIT, Cabinet Offices, Ministries, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and executive presence — able to craft compelling policy briefs, proposals, briefings, and presentations, and to represent SpaceXSI effectively in senior government and industry forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical AI concepts into clear policy, mission, and business value language for diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or significantly contributing to cross-functional teams in fast-paced, matrixed organizations; comfort operating with high autonomy and ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for SpaceXSI’s mission to understand the universe and a genuine interest in the responsible, high-impact deployment of frontier AI for public good&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel, &amp;lt;25%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to attend political and industry events on behalf of SpaceXSI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility required, including long hours and weekend work when necessary to support operations and critical project timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is based in London, UK and requires being onsite – remote work not considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SpaceXSI is an equal opportunity employer. For details on data processing, view our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.ai/legal/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

5d1df9c18075bd6a.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ensono, our purpose is to be a relentless ally, disrupting the status quo and enabling our clients to Do Great Things. As a trusted technology adviser and managed services provider, we help clients navigate continuous change and embrace innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We deliver world-class transformational services across AI, hybrid cloud, infrastructure, mainframe, data, IdAM, and cloud-native solutions, simplifying complex business challenges and creating new pathways to success. Headquartered in the USA and backed by private equity, Ensono has a strong track record in the UK and Europe, with growth plans built on trusted partnerships and deep industry expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Business Development Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a pivotal role in accelerating Ensono’s growth in the UK by identifying, developing and converting opportunities with organisations that align to our Ideal Client Profile (ICP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take a proactive, insight-led approach to opening new client relationships and building a high-quality pipeline of net-new logo opportunities. Using market intelligence, targeted research and AI-enabled tools, you will identify where Ensono can add the greatest value, develop compelling account and pursuit strategies, and create actionable business development initiatives that bring our full portfolio of capabilities to the UK market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with senior sales leaders, sales and wider go-to-market teams, you will help shape opportunities from initial prospect identification through to proposition and pursuit development. You will bring strong commercial judgement, curiosity and creativity, using client and market insight to turn potential opportunities into meaningful business conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will be an accomplished business development professional with a strong track record of creating new opportunities and engaging senior stakeholders. You will be confident using AI and data to sharpen prospecting and account strategies, an excellent communicator, and a collaborative self-starter with the energy and commercial focus to help Ensono win new clients and deliver sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Your Success Will Be Measured and Rewarded&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Ensono, we want great business development to deliver great outcomes and be recognised accordingly. Success in this role will be measured through the number and quality of leads you generate, the new-logo opportunities and pipeline you create, and your contribution to converting those opportunities into sustainable growth. You&#39;ll have clear lead-generation and pipeline objectives, with strong performance recognised and rewarded through Ensono&#39;s incentive arrangements, eligibility for Presidents Club nomination, and recognition via the global Elevate recognition platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Generation &amp;amp; New Logo Pipeline Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactively generate and qualify leads within organisations aligned to Ensono’s Ideal Client Profile (ICP), using targeted, multi-channel outreach to build a high-quality pipeline of net-new logo opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Account Prospecting: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop and execute focused prospecting plans across priority accounts, identifying key decisionmakers, buying signals and relevant entry points for Ensono.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with New Logo Sellers: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with New Logo Sales to identify, engage and qualify prospective clients, providing insight and account intelligence that helps open doors and progress opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Whitespace Identification: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct targeted research across industries, markets and competitors to identify whitespace, emerging client needs and new opportunities for Ensono.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enabled Business Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Use AI extensively to enhance prospect research, identify buying signals, personalise outreach, develop account strategies and increase the effectiveness and scale of lead-generation activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Account Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Own and continually refine Target Account Lists (TALs), prioritising activity based on market intelligence, engagement data, seller input and opportunity potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Relationship Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Build relationships with key decision-makers and influencers, creating relevant conversations that connect client priorities with Ensono’s capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Qualification &amp;amp; Opportunity Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Qualify prospective opportunities and work with sellers to move strong leads through the early stages of the sales cycle, ensuring effective handover and continued momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Propositions &amp;amp; Pitches: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute insight and research to tailored propositions, pitches and pursuit activity that demonstrate Ensono’s value and differentiation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work across Sales, Marketing, Alliances and solution teams to coordinate campaigns, account-based activity and market initiatives that generate demand and create new opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Effectiveness &amp;amp; Conversion: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyse outreach, engagement and conversion data to continuously improve targeting, messaging, prospecting methods and lead quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM &amp;amp; Pipeline Discipline: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain accurate CRM data and account intelligence, providing clear visibility of prospecting activity, lead progression and pipeline development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Deliver against defined lead-generation and pipeline objectives, measuring success through qualified leads, opportunities created, pipeline progression and contribution to new-logo growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will being to Ensono&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 8+ years of experience in business development, new logo acquisition, sales, or sales support within the IT/managed services industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of supporting successful client acquisition and building net-new pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analysing sales performance and market data to inform BD strategy and improve conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate research and market intelligence into actionable go-to-market plays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting partnership development and structured pursuit cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of managed services, cloud solutions, and IT infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, proposal creation, and stakeholder-engagement skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage CRM hygiene and support process improvements to accelerate BD effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with the ability to identify whitespace opportunities and influence decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, results-oriented, and able to operate independently and collaboratively in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel when needed for client and stakeholder engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a people-first business, people are at the heart of everything we do here. We offer our associates a safe environment where learning, knowledge sharing, and open communication is encouraged. Whether at one of the internal social events, competency meet-ups, hackathons or as part of one or more of our global Community Groups, such as Beautiful Brains (for the neurodiverse and curious), HERO (helping to education regarding orientation), E-Vets (Ensono veteran community) and many more, we strive to ensure that everyone feels welcome, included, and valued. Additionally, our standard benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base with uncapped commission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work from a range of flexible locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prestigious sales and broader team recognition with Annual Presidents Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starting with 27 days annual leave (plus bank holidays) – accruing to 30&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1/2 day leave on your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical options at 5 &amp;amp; 10 years&#39; service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 days study leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous company pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payroll giving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced paternity and maternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity appreciation program incentive plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional perks such as discounted gym memberships, cycle scheme, EAP and more.&amp;nbsp; If this all sounds great, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

4d85993aaf2c1e5e.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Stoke-on-Trent ST1&lt;br&gt;Training Period: Will be conducted Monday to Friday, 9am to 6pm for the first four weeks&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working hours: 40 hours per week, 5 days out of any 7 (8 hours a day, between 7:50am - 2am)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remuneration Package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Up to&amp;nbsp;20%&amp;nbsp;annual&amp;nbsp;company bonus and u&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nsociable hours allowance, when applicable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office-based for the first 4 months (probation and training period) - this will allow you to get to know the team, soak up crucial knowledge and benefit from face to face support whilst learning the role!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working (2 days in the office) available after successful completion of probation period&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Providing the best in class service to our players needs lots of work.&amp;nbsp;Your energy and passion will be put to good use, and the more you give, the more you’ll get in return.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LiveScore Group is home to LiveScore, LiveScore Bet and Virgin Bet, three of the most exciting brands in the sports and gaming industries today. We are passionate and excited about what we do in the Sports Media, Gaming and Betting sector and are proud of the high ratings we have achieved. We live our values, aiming to enhance and increase the enjoyment of sport through innovative products and immersive experiences. Trust is important in how we work, ensuring we are a collaborative unit who holds each other accountable. Relentlessly ambitious in everything we do, we embrace change and understand that failure is part of success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use our platform for positive social change and work to build a company our employees are proud to work for. We have a long-term commitment to diversity and inclusion. Our I.D.E.A (Inclusion, Diversity, Equality, Awareness) Forum is critical to our business and is embedded in our organisational structure to support a sense of belonging for everyone and to create a culture that allows all employees to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know a job description can often deter an applicant who does not believe they match 100% of our requirements. If you are interested in this position and have relevant experience, then we would still love to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Act as a first point of contact for our players providing them with a resolution to their sporting or gaming query. Sports betting happens quickly; in this role we will expect you to think fast and react even faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Try to resolve everything, first time, every time. With complex issues, you should ascertain urgency and follow the appropriate next steps in line with the department guidelines, escalating issues to the right department or Service Lead where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time is of the essence. You’d need to manage all tasks in an efficient and timely manner. If you follow the escalation procedure, keep track and see it through resolution, too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numbers are important. We need tip-top mathematicians to provide our players with transactional advice on banking, deposits, withdrawals, pricing and calculation of bet settlements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The art of conversation. You’d need to communicate effectively and efficiently with players, colleagues, Service Leads and the Management Team to ensure delivery of business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit the spot. Our department KPIs need to be met (or exceeded) and so we ask that you’re fast, efficient and that you get it right first time to thrill our players and reduce duplicate contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge is power - Keep on top of sports, as well as our other products and tools, to ensure you’re keeping up with our players, and with the business and department’s strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other departments, take part in projects, and attend meetings at other locations as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have fun, making fun – Contribute to, and promote, a positive working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a constant, positive role model and drive to inspire others to have fun whilst working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be proactive and demonstrate Real Time Resource Management awareness maintaining service levels and efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deflect Operator Complaints by handling 2&lt;sup&gt;nd&lt;/sup&gt; line escalations and finding positive solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a flexible attitude towards shift patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Knowledge and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A key understanding of the business and department OKRs with a determination to achieve and exceed targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical problem solver with a focus on helping develop internal functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to bring outstanding issues to a resolution, building key relationships across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with key stakeholders raising critical issues and reduce the customer propensity to contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To escalate and help guide company decisions through sharing voice of the player feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A problem solver whilst showing commercial awareness for each player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert in the group marketing initiatives and internal functions and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To be able to resolve complex queries and show a commitment in helping guide the CS Advisor group.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain &amp;amp; exceed the internal QA score going above and beyond for each customer contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert in handling multiple Live Chat, email &amp;amp; social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding customer handling skills, as well as oral and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An investigative approach whilst fact-finding to guarantee first contact resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent PC skills, who is an expert with Excel and the web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast and accurate typing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports knowledge &amp;amp; a passion for sports is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Performance bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working for all staff with flexible working opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Healthcare scheme + Employee Enhanced Assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Family Leave - Maternity, Shared Parental &amp;amp; Adoption Leave: up to 6 months at full pay and 6 months at half pay. Paternity leave: up to 4 weeks at full pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised gym membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance (x3 salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory Pension Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily snacks, quality coffee, soft drinks and regular socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

cff4e4fc2bb888b2.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Avetta is building the largest global community of hiring clients and suppliers that are Ready to Work. Its unified platform streamlines compliance, prequalification, safety and performance benchmarking in a single, integrated experience. Trusted by 360,000 businesses across more than 120 countries, Avetta blends AI-driven insights and human expertise to close risk gaps and strengthen supplier reliability so projects start on time, risks are managed proactively and operations scale with certainty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUMMARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Executive will play a key role in expanding Avetta&#39;s footprint by driving new business with mid-market and enterprise clients in the EMEA region. This role requires a consultative sales approach - listening, uncovering challenges, and crafting solutions that deliver measurable impact. The ideal candidate has a track record of closing mid to high-value SaaS deals, managing complex sales cycles, and meeting revenue targets. This includes experience working with large multinational companies, engaging complex buying committees and buyer journeys, and applying proven methodologies such as MEDDPICC - &amp;nbsp;with exposure to Challenger selling principles - to drive success. At Level I, the Account Executive operates with active guidance from sales leadership, building proficiency in Avetta&#39;s sales motion, methodology, and buyer dynamics. The Account Executive owns the primary relationship with prospective Avetta clients before and during their buyer journey. Once a prospect becomes a client, the Account Executive continues to manage and service the relationship until the account is fully established, at which point it transitions to the Account Management Team for ongoing support and expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role, working three days a week in our beautiful Maidenhead Office.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ESSENTIAL DUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new client acquisition by identifying and engaging mid-market and enterprise prospects, building relationships with key decision-makers, and developing strategies to generate business opportunities and grow Avetta&#39;s sales pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the full sales cycle - from prospecting and qualification through presentations, negotiations, and signed agreements - while partnering with internal teams to ensure client needs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply MEDDPICC to qualify and progress opportunities, developing proficiency in the methodology with coaching from leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a weekly emphasis on business development initiatives to ensure consistent progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently work toward revenue goals while keeping a well-managed pipeline in Salesforce, and provide clear, timely forecasts and insights to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with an assigned Sales Development Representative to execute targeted prospecting strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Avetta at industry trade shows and engage in networking activities to build relationships and promote Avetta&#39;s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct comprehensive Avetta Overview Presentations and Product Demonstrations online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel regularly to client sites and key accounts to facilitate in-person meetings, plus sales events, conferences, and other client-facing engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide essential support to new clients during the initial launch phase and throughout the first ninety days, with a focus on maximizing revenue and ensuring client success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in weekly 1-on-1 meetings and team calls to stay aligned with Avetta&#39;s goals and strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend additional trainings, meetings, and seminars as required, and adhere to other duties assigned to contribute to Avetta&#39;s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IDEAL EXPERIENCE, EDUCATION &amp;amp; TRAINING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 - 5 years of SaaS sales experience, including exposure to both mid-market and enterprise-level SaaS sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a structured sales methodology such as MEDDPICC; exposure to Challenger selling a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling safety-related products or services, working with contractors, working in procurement, or working in an industry that Avetta has current customers is considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills - this role requires significant travel, meeting coordination, and RFP/RFI/RFQ response management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior communication - exceptional interpersonal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong public speaking - ability to confidently present to groups, maintain engagement, and communicate complex topics with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated - able to set and pursue goals with guidance and support from sales leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical understanding - able to grasp and communicate SaaS software functionality and demonstrate product capabilities to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ethical - embodies Avetta&#39;s core values of honesty and integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OTHER DESIRED TRAITS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management, technical proficiency (CRM/Salesforce), problem-solving, attention to detail, and adaptability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To apply for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Account Executive- Enterprise EMEA &lt;/strong&gt;position, please submit your online application by December 4th, at 11:59 PM PST.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

7316e499c8999c3d.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK Remote (GMT timezone)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Contract (B2B)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About YLD:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to help our clients keep moving forward. We work with them to build the skills and capabilities they need to stay ahead of the competition, and we know our success only happens when they succeed. We’re a team of curious, talented people, and we’re committed to making YLD a place where great people want to work, grow, and stay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a remote-first consultancy specialising in software engineering, product design, and data. Our teams are based across London, Lisbon, and Porto, and we create digital solutions that continue to deliver value long after our work is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer at YLD, you’ll be part of a client team building innovative products. We’re looking for someone curious, passionate, driven, and enthusiastic. You should be skilled in problem-solving and experienced in designing scalable, resilient, and fault-tolerant architectures. You’re also an effective communicator and a strong team player. Together with your team, you’ll thrive in a fast-paced engineering environment, delivering outstanding results and exciting projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Kubernetes knowledge, including the API, controllers, scheduling and networking;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Golang, to the level where you can write, test and maintain a Kubernetes operator;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Terraform, to the level where you own and review the modules that provision clusters;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on AWS experience is mandatory; experience with other cloud providers is a plus;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working grasp of distributed systems: consistency models, replication, consensus and network partitions. You can reason about what happens when parts of a system disagree or can&#39;t reach each other;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated or financial systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with AI tools for most of your day, with the judgement to review their output and to adopt new technologies where they add value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to work with a forward-thinking, ethical, and fun group of people and to develop and grow your skills in a fast-moving business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our typical recruitment process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1st Interview with a Talent Partner (30/45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview with our Senior Developers (1h30)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final chat with our Client Partner (30/45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/yld.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get a glimpse of what it&#39;s like working at YLD! 🤳&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/yld/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out our LinkedIn page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We live and breathe our values, and know you will too:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Including everyone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationships built on honesty and ethics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspiring solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winning together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity in all its forms. We do not discriminate based on race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, pregnancy or maternity, age, marital status, or disability. We also offer a remote-first working environment, with flexible working and work–life balance as standard for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

80247d9be9889a2a.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We’re seeking an entrepreneurial, high-performing New Business Sales Executive to fuel our continued expansion across London &amp;amp; EMEA, focused on net-new logo acquisition within Financial Services (BuySide &amp;amp; Sell Side Institutional Investment).&lt;br&gt;This is a rare opportunity to join a hyper-growth company where you will sell a category-defining GenAI&amp;nbsp;platform that is transforming how the investment world accesses and interprets information. You will play&amp;nbsp;a pivotal role in shaping our regional growth trajectory and win big along the way!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven success selling SaaS technology to Hedge Funds, Asset Managers, and Investment&amp;nbsp;Banks across the U.K., Ireland, and Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong track record of exceeding new-business targets in a high-volume, high-velocity B2Bsales environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Expert prospector with the discipline to drive the full sales cycle—from cold outreach and&amp;nbsp;discovery to demo, trial, and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Natural relationship-builder who influences stakeholders across complex organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Energetic, curious, and resourceful, with a reputation for ownership, initiative, and consistent&amp;nbsp;overachievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Exceptional communicator with outstanding presentation and storytelling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to simplify complex concepts and articulate a compelling value narrative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comfortable traveling within the region as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own the end-to-end new-business sales process in your territory, targeting hedge funds, asset managers, banks, and research teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive net-new logo acquisition through rigorous prospecting, outreach, demos, trials, and&amp;nbsp;negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain a robust pipeline, forecasting with accuracy and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Marketing to amplify AlphaSense&#39;s brand presence and regional market penetration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner with Product Specialists to deliver high-impact trials and exceptional client experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Surface client and market insights to Product, Content, and Marketing to enrich platform&amp;nbsp;innovation and GTM strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

98fc4c3a04f9eb42.description:
&lt;p&gt;Toast is driven by building the restaurant platform that helps restaurants adapt, take control, and get back to what they do best: building the businesses they love. As an &lt;strong&gt;Inside&lt;/strong&gt; Sales Account Executive, you will be part of a team that is transforming the way restaurants operate. Using a consultative approach, you will prospect, build relationships, and sign up new restaurateurs across the UK by understanding their unique needs, you will develop a customized solution that helps their business thrive. We need your passion and expertise to help us build the Toast brand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid role with 3 days in our London office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London W1W 8BJ, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;roll&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*?&amp;nbsp; (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate list of prospective restaurants and manage the entire sales cycle from initial call to close &lt;strong&gt;(experience with self-sourcing clients is a huge plus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct demos and develop a solution that best meets the prospect’s needs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with teams across the business to ensure that expectations set during the sales process are met in delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Salesforce (our CRM) to manage all sales activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the competitive landscape and determine how to best position Toast in the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you have the right &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ingredients*&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;? (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in a sourcing or closing sales role, restaurant operations, or a relatable field and industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organisational and presentation skills with the ability to sell and negotiate at all decision-making levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of success in meeting and exceeding goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial and team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, creative, and flexible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General technical proficiency with software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce CRM is a nice to have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at Toast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, one of our company values is that we&#39;re hungry to build and learn. We believe learning new AI tools empowers us to build for our customers faster, more independently, and with higher quality. We provide these tools across all disciplines, from Engineering and Product to Sales and Support, and are inspired by how our Toasters are already driving real value with them. The people who thrive here are those who embrace changes that let us build more for our customers; it’s a core part of our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Total Rewards Philosophy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to provide competitive compensation and benefits programs that help to attract, retain, and motivate the best and brightest people in our industry. Our total rewards package goes beyond great earnings potential and provides the means to a healthy lifestyle with the flexibility to meet Toasters’ changing needs. Learn more about our benefits at &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Toast Uses AI in its Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Throughout the hiring process, our goal is to get to know you. We use AI tools to support our recruiters and interviewers with tasks like note-taking, summarization, and documentation of interviews to ensure they can be fully focused on your conversation. All hiring decisions are made by people. We ask that you complete interviews and assessments on your own, without real-time AI tools, recording, or transcription bots, unless we tell you otherwise in advance. To learn more: &lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We embrace a hybrid work model that fosters in-person collaboration while valuing individual needs. Our goal is to build a strong culture of connection as we work together to empower the hospitality community, regardless of location. Please visit the Locations page on our career site to learn more about our in-office expectations by region:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Are the Secret Ingredient in Our Recipe for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, our employees are our secret ingredient—when they thrive, we thrive. The restaurant industry brings together people with a wide range of backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we value that same breadth at Toast. We strive to build a culture grounded in authenticity, respect, and humility, where every Toaster has a real opportunity to grow, contribute, and do their best work—raising the bar in delivering exceptional experiences for our customers and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast is committed to creating an accessible and inclusive hiring process. As part of this commitment, we strive to provide reasonable accommodations for persons with disabilities to enable them to access the hiring process. If you need an accommodation to access the job application or interview process, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;------&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For roles in the United States, it is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

f11560ad28da1db2.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Redwood, we empower our customers with lights-out automation for their mission-critical business processes.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Redwood Software is the leading orchestration platform for the autonomous enterprise, driving business transformation at the lowest total cost of ownership. Redwood empowers organizations to intelligently automate and orchestrate mission-critical business and IT processes across complex ERP, hybrid cloud, data and emerging agentic AI systems. Through its SaaS-first automation fabric—with AI embedded across the automation lifecycle—Redwood accelerates the path to autonomous operations. Backed by 30 years of experience and trusted by more than 50% of the Fortune 50, Redwood helps organizations unlock human potential to focus on innovation, growth and what’s next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CORE VALUES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;One Team. One Redwood&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Make Your Own Weather&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Obsess over Customer Success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work the Problem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Be Curious&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own the Outcome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Respect Each Other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The Professional Services Consultant role is instrumental in assisting Redwood customers ranging from Fortune global enterprises to midsized businesses to leverage our solutions to orchestrate automation across distributed and heterogeneous platforms and enterprise business applications including SAP, Oracle, PeopleSoft, data warehousing and OS tasks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The range of responsibilities includes product installation and configuration, training, conducting workshops and providing best practices guidance to advance our customer’s automation business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Assist customers with installation, configuration, training and use of Redwood solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Perform analysis, scoping, and effort estimation to meet customer requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide configuration, architecture &amp;amp; installation recommendations based on product best practices &amp;amp; customer needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with other Redwood resources including Engagement Managers to update project status, timeline, effort, and expected completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively and professionally with business and technical contacts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Utilize supporting materials (project plan templates, architecture diagrams, etc) to communicate findings &amp;amp; recommendations to the customer or internally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Travel to customers, partners, and Redwood Software sites as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR EXPERIENCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;5+ years of IT Consulting experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ability to augment code in Java, C++, C#/.NET or other object-oriented design language.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proven competence in IT Consulting, including training, installation, architecture design, and testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Interest in problem-solving &amp;amp; learning new technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience or an understanding of SaaS solutions &amp;amp; integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of one or more Cloud providers (AWS, Azure, GCP, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of one or more identity providers (Active Directory, Okta, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Knowledge and understanding of SSO, particularly SAML providers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of SAP jobs scheduling or other scheduling solutions (Autosys, Control-M)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with UNIX, Windows, &amp;amp; Linux at a power user level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience and understanding of API usage, including REST and SOAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of communication protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and SSH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Good communication &amp;amp; presentation skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent time management and task management skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage and prioritize multiple client projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to learn on the go/on the job in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;css-1i27f3a&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-ey7qxc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1s1axh3&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;jobPostingDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you like growth and working with happy, enthusiastic over-achievers, you&#39;ll enjoy your career with us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE LEGAL BIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Redwood is an equal opportunity employer. Redwood prohibits unlawful discrimination based on race, colour, religion, sex, gender identity, marital or veteran status, age, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information or characteristics (or those of a family member), sexual orientation, pregnancy or any other consideration made unlawful by regional or local laws. We also prohibit discrimination based on a perception that anyone has any of those characteristics or is associated with a person who has or is perceived as having any of those characteristics. All such discrimination is unlawful and will have a zero tolerance policy applied to it.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redwood will comply with all local data protection laws, including GDPR when it comes to the handling and processing of personal data. Should you wish for us to remove your personal data from our recruitment database, please email us directly at -----
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

adca9cad8d3cdd14.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Throughout our worldwide network of experts, clients and communities, we are renowned for our leadership in fire protection engineering – a legacy of responsibility we have proudly upheld since 1939. Today, our expertise extends broadly across closely related security and risk-based fields – from accessibility consulting and risk analysis to process safety, forensic investigations, security risk consulting, emergency management, digital innovation and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our engineers and consultants collaborate to solve complex safety and security challenges, ensuring our clients can protect what matters most. For over 80 years, we have helped mitigate risks that threaten lives, property and reputations. Through technology, expertise and industry-leading research, we remain dedicated to our purpose of making our world safe, secure and resilient.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we believe that creating and sustaining a culture of trust, integrity and professional growth starts with putting our people first. Our employees are our greatest strength, and we value the unique perspectives and talents they bring to our organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our wide range of Global Employee Networks connect people from across the organization, supporting career development and providing forums for individuals to share experiences on topics they’re passionate about. Together, we are cultivating a connected culture where everyone has the opportunity to learn, grow and succeed together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Jensen Hughes are seeking an experienced and commercially minded Principal Fire Engineer to join our growing team in London. This is a technical leadership role offering the opportunity to deliver complex fire engineering projects across a diverse portfolio of sectors including commercial, residential, healthcare, education, industrial, and infrastructure developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Principal Fire Engineer, you will play a key role in shaping fire safety strategies, ensuring regulatory compliance, and supporting business growth through strong client relationships and technical innovation. You will not only lead on some of the industry’s most exciting projects but also have a key role in shaping the future talent within our teams through mentorship and development opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us to grow your career?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are the largest fire consultancy in Europe with offices located in Belgium, Finland, Denmark, Italy, and the UK &amp;amp; Ireland. Our reputation for providing innovative, design-focused solutions has made us the consultant of choice for many of Europe’s leading property clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Principal Engineer you will be an integral part of a dynamic technical team, working with other experienced Engineers, Surveyors and teams including our Forensics division. You will work on the industry&#39;s leading technical projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working with us offers an exciting range of opportunities to develop your career within a supportive and diverse team that always strives to do the right thing for our people, clients and communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will be given early the opportunity to progress rapidly. Jensen Hughes encourages all Engineers to achieve chartered status and offer help and support during the process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead and deliver complex fire engineering projects from inception through to completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop fire strategies for a wide range of new-build and existing building projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Undertake fire safety engineering analyses, including evacuation modelling, smoke control assessments, and performance-based design solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide expert advice on compliance with UK Building Regulations, Approved Document B, and relevant fire safety legislation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Review and approve technical reports, calculations, and design documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Liaise with architects, developers, contractors, approval authorities, and wider project teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as a technical lead and mentor for junior and mid-level engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to business development activities, including client engagement, tender submissions, and project proposals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
